{
    "chapter_num": 4,
    "verses_count": 25,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Satan Tempts Jesus"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Jesus was led up by the Spirit into the wilderness to be tempted by the devil. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when He had fasted forty days and forty nights, afterward He was hungry. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when the tempter came to Him, he said, “If You are the Son of God, command that these stones become bread.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But He answered and said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“It is written,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘Man shall not live by bread alone, but by every word that proceeds from the mouth of God.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the devil took Him up into the holy city, set Him on the pinnacle of the temple, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and said to Him, “If You are the Son of God, throw Yourself down. For it is written:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "‘He shall give His angels charge over you,’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "‘In"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "their"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "hands they shall bear you up,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Lest you dash your foot against a stone.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " ”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jesus said to him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“It is written again,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘You shall not"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "test"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "tempt the Lord your God.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Again, the devil took Him up on an exceedingly high mountain, and showed Him all the kingdoms of the world and their glory. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said to Him, “All these things I will give You if You will fall down and worship me.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Jesus said to him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M Get behind Me"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Away with you, Satan! For it is written,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘You shall worship the Lord your God, and Him only you shall serve.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the devil left Him, and behold, angels came and ministered to Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Begins His Galilean Ministry"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when Jesus heard that John had been put in prison, He departed to Galilee. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And leaving Nazareth, He came and dwelt in Capernaum, which is by the sea, in the regions of Zebulun and Naphtali, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that it might be fulfilled which was spoken by Isaiah the prophet, saying:"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“The"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "land of Zebulun and the land of Naphtali,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "By"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "the way of the sea, beyond the Jordan,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Galilee of the Gentiles:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "The people who sat in darkness have seen a great light,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And upon those who sat in the region and shadow of death"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Light has dawned.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "From that time Jesus began to preach and to say, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Repent, for the kingdom of heaven"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "has drawn near"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "is at hand.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Four Fishermen Called as Disciples"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Jesus, walking by the Sea of Galilee, saw two brothers, Simon called Peter, and Andrew his brother, casting a net into the sea; for they were fishermen. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Follow Me, and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "I will make you fishers of men.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "They immediately left "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "their"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " nets and followed Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Going on from there, He saw two other brothers, James "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the son"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Zebedee, and John his brother, in the boat with Zebedee their father, mending their nets. He called them, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and immediately they left the boat and their father, and followed Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Heals a Great Multitude"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Jesus went about all Galilee, teaching in their synagogues, preaching the gospel of the kingdom, and healing all kinds of sickness and all kinds of disease among the people. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. the report of Him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "His fame went throughout all Syria; and they brought to Him all sick people who were afflicted with various diseases and torments, and those who were demon-possessed, epileptics, and paralytics; and He healed them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Great multitudes followed Him—from Galilee, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "from"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Ten Cities"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Decapolis, Jerusalem, Judea, and beyond the Jordan."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}